,"settings":{"code":"<script src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/recaptcha\/api.js\" async defer><\/script>\n<div class=\"page-width page-width--narrow page-content\" style=\"padding:0 40px\">\n  <div class=\"rte rte--nomargin\">\n        <form method=\"POST\" name=\"fa-form-1\" action=\"https:\/\/webhook.frontapp.com\/forms\/natural_baby_shower\/vLbtOu-vvpLKb7MTSFf-I0nDdHTJYuEpmzEq5I50ObLHC-0TzxaqUPJezY1b9qwm9NLQMiASzCNqGq9aNwe0RrsncU4NQZAkDlZZM4vOdQ\" enctype=\"multipart\/form-data\" accept-charset=\"utf-8\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"subject\" value=\"New price match request\" \/>\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"body\" value=\"New price match request.\" \/>\n          {%- if customer -%}\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label style=\"display:inline\" for=\"name\">Account name: <\/label><b>{{ customer.first_name }} {{ customer.last_name }}<\/b><\/div>\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"name\" value=\"{{ customer.first_name}} {{ customer.last_name }}\" \/>\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label style=\"display:inline\" for=\"email\">Account email: <\/label><b>{{ customer.email }}<\/b><\/div>\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"email\" value=\"{{ customer.email }}\" \/>\n            {%- if customer.phone == blank -%}\n            <div><label for=\"phone\">Phone<\/label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"phone\" placeholder=\"+44 1234 123456\" required=\"\" autocomplete=\"tel\" \/><\/div>\n            {%- else -%}\n            <div class=\"form_front\"><label style=\"display:inline\" for=\"phone\">Account phone: <\/label><b>{{ customer.phone }}<\/b><\/div>\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"phone\" value=\"{{ customer.phone }}\" \/>\n            {%- endif -%}\n          {%- else -%}\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"name\">Name<\/label> <input style=\"width:250px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Full name\" autocomplete=\"cc-name\" \/><\/div>\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"email\">Email<\/label> <input style=\"width:350px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" required=\"\" autocomplete=\"email\" \/><\/div>\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"phone\">Contact number<\/label> <input style=\"width:250px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" type=\"text\" name=\"phone\" placeholder=\"+44 1234 123456\" required=\"\" autocomplete=\"tel\" \/><\/div> \n          {%- endif -%}\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"url1\">Our product URL<\/label> <input style=\"width:350px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" type=\"text\" name=\"url1\" placeholder=\"https:\/\/www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk\/products\/muslin-cloth-white\" required=\"\" \/><\/div>\n          <div>\n\t\t<div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"url1\">Competitors product URL (optional)<\/label> <input style=\"width:350px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" type=\"text\" name=\"url2\" placeholder=\"https:\/\/www.competitor.co.uk\/product\" \/><\/div>\n          <div>\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"info\">Additional info (optional)<\/label><textarea style=\"height: 100px; width:350px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" name=\"info\"><\/textarea><\/div>\n          <div class=\"form_front\"><label for=\"file\">Send us an image (optional)<\/label><input type=\"file\" name=\"attachment\" \/><\/div> <p> <\/p>\n          <div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\" id=\"html_element\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"g-recaptcha\" data-sitekey=\"6Ldb5xITAAAAAD0Rm1riCr6vkH9anasfQrvSmxpR\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\" class=\"btn\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\"><\/div>\n <p> <\/p>\n            \n          <\/div>\n        <\/form>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--14836576321614__1811ee08-e333-48a1-92d1-f80e191b3b61-liquid-1"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".index-section {margin: 0; padding: 0;}"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":false,"lazyload_images":false}},"a744caa2-aa55-4be3-9108-30fdd1475c3b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14836576321614__a744caa2-aa55-4be3-9108-30fdd1475c3b-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Price match conditions","heading_size":"h3"}},"template--14836576321614__a744caa2-aa55-4be3-9108-30fdd1475c3b-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>At Natural Baby Shower, our mission is to offer high-quality, natural, and sustainable products for parents, babies, and the planet. Our commitment to fair pricing is reflected in our price match service, ensuring you receive the most competitive prices on our products. Before requesting a match, please consider the following:<\/p><ul><li>Confirm that the item is readily available on the competitor's website for immediate dispatch.<\/li><li>Ensure the product is an exact match with ours in terms of size, colour, make, and model.<\/li><li>Note that auction sites like eBay are not eligible for matching, as we aim to ensure a fair and transparent comparison.<\/li><li>While we strive to provide the best offers, please be aware that we cannot retrospectively match prices once the item has been purchased.<\/li><li>The quoted response time refers to our standard office hours, and requests made outside of these hours will be addressed promptly upon our return.<\/li><\/ul><p>Our dedication to offering you the best value. If your requested price proves exceptionally competitive, we'll send you a personalised quote with our very best offer. Thank you for considering Natural Baby Shower.<\/p><p><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14836576321614__a744caa2-aa55-4be3-9108-30fdd1475c3b-heading-1","template--14836576321614__a744caa2-aa55-4be3-9108-30fdd1475c3b-text-1"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".index-section {margin: 40px 0; padding: 30px 0 10px 0;}"],"settings":{"align_text":"left","narrow_column":true,"color_scheme":"3","divider":false}},"c24fb834-525b-48de-aa9e-c7232dd6beb3":{"type":"text-with-icons","blocks":{"template--14804242202702__c24fb834-525b-48de-aa9e-c7232dd6beb3-16820681588b00f539-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"plant","title":"","text":"<p>We research every brand and product before we sell it, to ensure they are one’s families can trust.<\/p>"}},"template--14804242202702__c24fb834-525b-48de-aa9e-c7232dd6beb3-16820681588b00f539-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"phone","title":"","text":"<p>We are proud of our expert customer service team who are always on hand to help answer any questions and offer their expert advice.<\/p>"}},"template--14804242202702__c24fb834-525b-48de-aa9e-c7232dd6beb3-16820681588b00f539-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"envelope","title":"","text":"<p>We want you to be able to shop with us with confidence so we offer a seamless and hassle-free 90-days returns process.<\/p>"}},"89c0dbb1-68f4-45d3-a65c-b38171613960":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"calendar","title":"","text":"<p>For extra peace of mind we offer our standard warranty on all our products against fault and breakage.<\/p>"}},"44baec0d-0193-4294-9bf8-aff3f6b0b1dc":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"package","title":"","text":"<p>All our packaging is sustainable and recyclable and we use only the essential amount with no space waste inside boxes.<\/p>"}},"918b0223-1fb2-4fb2-be99-fd9934f04b40":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"ribbon","title":"","text":"<p>We're rated 5 stars for our excellent customer service, delivery, aftercare and wide product range.<\/p>"}},"ee7a3dcc-c662-4a76-bb4b-dc7bcc7a5ee6":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"chat","title":"","text":"<p>We ask real parents to do real reviews on our products to ensure they really are best for baby and best for you.<\/p>"}},"9345f599-e0af-4795-a79d-27456203ba16":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"icon":"sales-tag","title":"","text":"<p>Earn points with every purchase you make, then turn those points into money off your next purchase.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--1480